{"strongs": "H6966", "word": "קוּם", "translit": "qum", "root": "צבע", "morph": "A:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "arise, stand", "definition": "[ קוּם ] verb arise, stand (see Biblical Hebrew); — Pe`al Perfect 3 masculine singular קָם Dan 3:24 , 3 masculine plural קָ֫מוּ Ezra 5:2 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יְקוּם Dan 6:20 ; Dan 7:24 , 3 feminine singular תְּקוּם Dan 2:39 ; Dan 2:44 3 masculine plural יְקוּמוּן Dan 7:10 ; Dan 7:17 ; Dan 7:24 ( ׳ יְקֻ ); Participle קָאֵם Dan 2:31 , plural קאמין Kt , קָֽיְמִין Qr , Dan 3:3 , emphatic קָֽאֲמַיָּא Dan 7:16 — 1. literally arise Dan 3:24 (i.e. from throne), Dan 6:20 (from bed). 2. figurative = come on the scene of history: of kingdom Dan 2:39 , king Dan 7:17 ; Dan 7:24 (both מִן of source), v Dan 7:24 . 3. arise (out of inaction), and build Ezra 5:2 , devour Dan 7:5 b. 4. stand , literal, לָקֳבֵל person Dan 2:31 , compare Dan 3:3 , קֳדָם person Dan 7:10 participle as noun, those standing (there) v Dan 7:16 . 5. endure , kingdom Dan 2:44 . Pa`el set up, establish an ordinance ( קְיָם ): Infinitive לְקַיָּמָה Dan 6:8 . Haph`el ( K § 45, 4 ) Perfect 3 masculine singular הֲקֵים Dan 3:2 +, וַהֲקִים Dan 6:2 , suffix הֱקִימֵהּ Dan 5:11 , אֲקִימֵהּ Dan 3:1 3 feminine singular הֱקִמַת Dan 7:5 2 masculine singular הֲקֵימְתּ Dan 3:12 ; Dan 3:18 1 singular הֲקֵ֫ימֶת לָא Dan 3:14 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יְהָקֵים ( K § 45, b )) Dan 5:21 ; Dan 6:16 , יְקִים Dan 2:44 ; Dan 4:14 Infinitive suffix לַהֲקָמוּתֵהּ Dan 6:4 Participle active מְהָקֵים Dan 2:21 — 1. set up , literal image Dan 3:1 ; Dan 3:2 ; Dan 3:3 (twice in verse); Dan 3:5 ; Dan 3:7 ; Dan 3:12 ; Dan 3:14 ; Dan 3:18 figurative kings Dan 2:21 , kingdom v Dan 2:44 . 2. lift up one side Dan 7:5 a ( Dr ). 3. establish , with accusative קְיָם Dan 6:16 (= Pa`el ), אֱסָרָא v. Dan 6:9 . 4. appoint Ezra 6:18 , 2 accusative Dan 5:11 suffix person + עַל Dan 6:4 , ל accusative of person + עַל Dan 4:14 ; Dan 5:21 ; Dan 6:2 . Hoph`al Perfect 3 feminine singular הֳקִימַת (variants in Str ; compare K § 45, 5 ; not Hebraism Nö GGA 1867, 1784 ; W CG 225, 253 ) Dan 7:4 be made to stand עַלרַגְיִן .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9856')\">BDB9856</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6965')\">H6965</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6966')\">H6966</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9855')\">BDB9855</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9857')\">BDB9857</entry></div><p> [<bdbarc>קוּם</bdbarc>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>arise, stand</highlightword> (see Biblical Hebrew); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Pe`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbarc>קָם</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,24)\">Dan 3:24</ref>, 3 masculine plural <bdbarc>קָ֫מוּ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,2)\">Ezra 5:2</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbarc>יְקוּם</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 6:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,20)\">Dan 6:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,24)\">Dan 7:24</ref>, 3 feminine singular <bdbarc>תְּקוּם</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:39\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,39)\">Dan 2:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:44\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,44)\">Dan 2:44</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbarc>יְקוּמוּן</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 7:10\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,10)\">Dan 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,17)\">Dan 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,24)\">Dan 7:24</ref> (<bdbarc>׳</bdbarc><bdbarc>יְקֻ</bdbarc>); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbarc>קָאֵם</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:31\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,31)\">Dan 2:31</ref>, plural <bdbarc>קאמין</bdbarc> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>, <bdbarc>קָֽיְמִין</bdbarc> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>, <ref ref=\"Dan 3:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,3)\">Dan 3:3</ref>, emphatic <bdbarc>קָֽאֲמַיָּא</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 7:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,16)\">Dan 7:16</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> literally <highlight>arise</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,24)\">Dan 3:24</ref> (i.e. from throne), <ref ref=\"Dan 6:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,20)\">Dan 6:20</ref> (from bed). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative = come on the scene of history: of kingdom <ref ref=\"Dan 2:39\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,39)\">Dan 2:39</ref>, king <ref ref=\"Dan 7:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,17)\">Dan 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,24)\">Dan 7:24</ref> (both <bdbarc>מִן</bdbarc> of source), v<ref ref=\"Dan 7:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,24)\">Dan 7:24</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>arise</highlight> (out of inaction), and build <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,2)\">Ezra 5:2</ref>, devour <ref ref=\"Dan 7:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,5)\">Dan 7:5</ref>b. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>stand</highlight>, literal, <bdbarc>לָקֳבֵל</bdbarc> person <ref ref=\"Dan 2:31\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,31)\">Dan 2:31</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Dan 3:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,3)\">Dan 3:3</ref>, <bdbarc>קֳדָם</bdbarc> person <ref ref=\"Dan 7:10\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,10)\">Dan 7:10</ref> participle as noun, <highlight>those standing</highlight> (there) v<ref ref=\"Dan 7:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,16)\">Dan 7:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>endure</highlight>, kingdom <ref ref=\"Dan 2:44\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,44)\">Dan 2:44</ref>. <b>Pa`el</b> <highlight>set up, establish</highlight> an ordinance (<bdbarc>קְיָם</bdbarc>): <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbarc>לְקַיָּמָה</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 6:8\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,8)\">Dan 6:8</ref>. <b>Haph`el</b> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">K<sup>§ 45, 4</sup></lookup>) <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbarc>הֲקֵים</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:2\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,2)\">Dan 3:2</ref> +, <bdbarc>וַהֲקִים</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 6:2\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,2)\">Dan 6:2</ref>, suffix <bdbarc>הֱקִימֵהּ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 5:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,11)\">Dan 5:11</ref>, <bdbarc>אֲקִימֵהּ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,1)\">Dan 3:1</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbarc>הֱקִמַת</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 7:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,5)\">Dan 7:5</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbarc>הֲקֵימְתּ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:12\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,12)\">Dan 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:18\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,18)\">Dan 3:18</ref> 1 singular <bdbarc>הֲקֵ֫ימֶת לָא</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:14\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,14)\">Dan 3:14</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbarc>יְהָקֵים</bdbarc> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">K<sup>§ 45, b</sup></lookup>)) <ref ref=\"Dan 5:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,21)\">Dan 5:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 6:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,16)\">Dan 6:16</ref>, <bdbarc>יְקִים</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:44\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,44)\">Dan 2:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 4:14\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,14)\">Dan 4:14</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> suffix <bdbarc>לַהֲקָמוּתֵהּ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 6:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,4)\">Dan 6:4</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> <bdbarc>מְהָקֵים</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,21)\">Dan 2:21</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>set up</highlight>, literal image <ref ref=\"Dan 3:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,1)\">Dan 3:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:2\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,2)\">Dan 3:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,3)\">Dan 3:3</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Dan 3:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,5)\">Dan 3:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,7)\">Dan 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:12\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,12)\">Dan 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:14\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,14)\">Dan 3:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:18\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,18)\">Dan 3:18</ref> figurative kings <ref ref=\"Dan 2:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,21)\">Dan 2:21</ref>, kingdom v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:44\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,44)\">Dan 2:44</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>lift up</highlight> one side <ref ref=\"Dan 7:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,5)\">Dan 7:5</ref> a (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>establish</highlight>, with accusative <bdbarc>קְיָם</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 6:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,16)\">Dan 6:16</ref> (= <b>Pa`el</b>), <bdbarc>אֱסָרָא</bdbarc> v.<ref ref=\"Dan 6:9\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,9)\">Dan 6:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>appoint</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:18\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,18)\">Ezra 6:18</ref>, 2 accusative <ref ref=\"Dan 5:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,11)\">Dan 5:11</ref> suffix person + <bdbarc>עַל</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 6:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,4)\">Dan 6:4</ref>, <bdbarc>ל</bdbarc> accusative of person + <bdbarc>עַל</bdbarc> <ref ref=